    "result": "Perfect! I've successfully added weekly subscription support to subtrack. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### Core Functionality\n1. **Updated `src/cycles.js`**:\n   - Added `WEEK: 'weekly'` to the CYCLE enum\n   - Updated `nextCharge()` to handle weekly billing (every 7 days from first charge)\n   - Changed `monthlyCents()` to use rounding instead of floor, with proper calculation for weekly: `price \u00d7 52 \u00f7 12`\n\n2. **Updated `bin/subtrack.js`**:\n   - Added support for `--every week` and `--every weekly` flags\n   - Updated error messages to mention \"month, year, or week\"\n   - Updated SHARE_PER_MONTH calculation to include weekly (52/12)\n   - Changed total calculation to use rounding for consistency\n\n3. **Updated `src/export.js`**:\n   - Now uses `monthlyCents()` directly for consistent monthly cost calculation\n\n4. **Fixed `src/renewals.js`**:\n   - Fixed sorting to use actual date comparison instead of shortLabel string comparison\n\n### Tests\n- Added comprehensive tests for weekly subscriptions in all test files\n- All 40 tests pass \u2705\n\n### Verification\nThe implementation correctly:\n- \u2705 Accepts `subtrack add \"Meal kit\" 59.90 --every week`\n- \u2705 Shows weekly plans with correct monthly cost (\u20ac259.57 for \u20ac59.90/week)\n- \u2705 Example verification: \u20ac12/week = \u20ac52.00/month (12 \u00d7 52 \u00f7 12) \u2713\n- \u2705 Lists renewals with weekly charges\n- \u2705 Weekly plans charge every 7 days from `--since` date\n- \u2705 Works with mixed monthly/yearly/weekly subscriptions\n- \u2705 All calculations rounded to nearest cent as specified",
